  "label": "Internet Meme Culture",
  "description": "The meme is part of a broader cultural phenomenon known as internet meme culture, which involves the creation, sharing, and modification of images, videos, or text with humorous or ironic captions. Understanding the meme requires knowledge of how internet memes function as a form of communication, often relying on relatability, irony, and shared cultural references.",
